ex:Mission a backlog:Mission ; rdfs:label "CourseGraph: a knowledge-graph assistant that answers questions from course PDFs with cited sources"@en ; backlog:hasMissionStatement "Give every Course student and Study group lead at İKÜ a local assistant that turns their course PDFs into a knowledge graph of documents, pages and topics, answers their questions only from that graph with the page each statement comes from, and refuses when the documents do not cover the question." ; backlog:hasMissionOutcome "A student uploads the PDFs of a course from one web page, asks a question in their own words and, within seconds, reads an answer whose every part links to the document and page it came from; when the material does not cover the question, the assistant says so instead of guessing." ; backlog:hasIntentOrigin backlog:IOrigin_Derived .
ex:Lineage a backlog:Lineage ; backlog:lineageForMission ex:Mission ; backlog:adoptsObligationSet backlog:OS_SDLC_v2 .
ex:Customer1 a backlog:Stakeholder ; rdfs:label "Güray Tahan"@en ; rdfs:comment "Customer (client): a study assistant that answers questions from their own course PDFs and shows the page each answer comes from"@en .
ex:Customer2 a backlog:Stakeholder ; rdfs:label "Hasan Mert Yıldırım"@en ; rdfs:comment "Customer (client): a study assistant that answers questions from their own course PDFs and shows the page each answer comes from"@en .
