ex:EndUser1 a backlog:Stakeholder ; rdfs:label "Course student"@en ; rdfs:comment "End user: İKÜ undergraduate students who study from the lecture slides and notes published on CATS - uploads the PDFs of a course and asks questions while revising, then opens the cited pages (weekly, laptop browser)"@en .
ex:EndUser2 a backlog:Stakeholder ; rdfs:label "Study group lead"@en ; rdfs:comment "End user: a student who organises a study group for one course and shares material with classmates - uploads the full PDF set of a course once and checks that answers cite the right slides (weekly, laptop browser)"@en .
