ex:D2 a backlog:ScopeDeliverable ; rdfs:label "Course ontology with a SKOS topic scheme and SHACL shapes"@en ; backlog:deliverableForArea ex:A1 ; backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Product ; backlog:hasProductScopeKind backlog:Kind_Functional .
ex:D3 a backlog:ScopeDeliverable ; rdfs:label "Hybrid retrieval (SPARQL filter plus embedding similarity) returning the top 3 chunks with page numbers"@en ; backlog:deliverableForArea ex:A2 ; backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Product ; backlog:hasProductScopeKind backlog:Kind_Functional .
ex:D4 a backlog:ScopeDeliverable ; rdfs:label "Local LLM answer through Ollama with page citations and a PROV-O record"@en ; backlog:deliverableForArea ex:A2 ; backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Product ; backlog:hasProductScopeKind backlog:Kind_Functional .
ex:D5 a backlog:ScopeDeliverable ; rdfs:label "An answer is returned in under 10 seconds for 90% of test questions on a student laptop"@en ; backlog:deliverableForArea ex:A2 ; backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Product ; backlog:hasProductScopeKind backlog:Kind_NonFunctional .
